    "text": "If the variance of the terms in an increasing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mn>11</mn></msub></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn></math> then the common difference of this <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> is<br />&nbsp;"
  },
